{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jYwsOGOJ3W1793784041.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人工智能股份今年大上大落，近期就再遭投資者拋售，當中從費城半導體指數的走勢，就可以看清情況。</p><p></p><p>費城半導體指數由半導體股份組成，坊間有不少人把他與道瓊斯工業平均指數、標準普爾500指數，以及納斯達克指數，合稱美股四大主要指數。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261104_QQ.SOX.CLEAN_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wmYeJLvtGs1793786964.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>費城半導體指數簡稱SOX，即是Semiconductor Sector Index，成立於1993年，由納斯達克交易所管理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261104_QQ.SOX.CLEAN_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jkf5uyAnRQ1793786941.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>成分股僅有30隻，覆蓋半導體產業的上中下游產業，指數以股份的市值計算權重，但為免單一股份影響過大，所以設有權重上限百分之12，目前權重最大股份是輝達，之後是博通、美光及AMD等。因為受到權重上限約束，所以市值約5萬億美元的輝達，只佔權重約一成二。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261104_QQ.SOX.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266R5id1rZJc1793786923.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>由於人工智能的基礎建設，以半導體為核心，所以費城半導體指數的變動，已成為人工智能產業的寒暑表。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12184-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%91%A8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:39.264998+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:31.024293+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:35.554675+00:00","content_hash":"9e0ff24a070b33d8cfca8035f9cff36d67ec438418d9e450707d4e1a1f51f660","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}